      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Subsection 23H(2B)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2B) If an interview friend is not chosen under subsection (2A), the\ninvestigating official must choose a representative of an Aboriginal\nlegal assistance organisation in the State or Territory in which the\nperson is located to be the person’s interview friend."
    },
