      "values:originalText": "Omit “Subsection (1) does”, substitute “Subsections (1) to (1E) do”.\n\nSchedule 3  Controlled operation disclosure offence\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2018\nNo. 75, 2018"
    },
    {
