      "cml:logicSummary": "Section applicability",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Section 86D of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the use of personal information by a target entity on or after the commencement of that section, whether the entity collected the information before, on or after that commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-4-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Applicability",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Section applicability",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Section 86E of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the disclosure of personal information on or after the commencement of that section, whether the person, body or authority making the disclosure collected the information before, on or after that commencement."
    },
